cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ANKUSI Wheel Fitment Dataset
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below and keep a
  visible link back to the canonical page, as required by CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: ANKUSI Wheels Engineering Team
    website: 'https://ankusiwheels.com/'
    city: Guangzhou
    country: CN
abstract: >-
  Open, machine-readable factory wheel specifications for 6,436 vehicle variants
  across 129 makes and 46 bolt patterns, model years 1940 to 2027. Fields include
  bolt pattern, centre bore in millimetres, lug count, OE wheel size and offset,
  plus commonly referenced flush and maximum aftermarket sizes. Compiled from
  published OEM specifications and cross-checked against independent fitment
  references.
keywords:
  - wheel fitment
  - bolt pattern
  - PCD
  - centre bore
  - wheel offset
  - automotive
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: 'https://ankusiwheels.com/wheel-fitment-dataset/'
version: 2026.09.18
date-released: '2026-09-18'
